{"id":"f5fbbc7a13ebbdd7","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fixed-point.md","title":"df-fixed-point","display":"df-fixed-point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"5","label":"16-df-fixed-point","aliases":["16-df-fixed-point","Fixed point of a nucleus"],"display":"df-fixed-point","depends_on":["[[16-df-nucleus]]","[[16-df-elementary-topos]]"],"source":"Section 5.6, p.356 (PDF376); fixed-point equaliser construction after Lemma 5.6.5","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fixed-point</span><span>Fixed point of a nucleus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fixed-point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7b9d7a3ecba84e9e\" href=\"?note=7b9d7a3ecba84e9e\" title=\"16-df-nucleus\">16-df-nucleus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3744a99e6a5c0037\" href=\"?note=3744a99e6a5c0037\" title=\"16-df-elementary-topos\">16-df-elementary-topos</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Section 5.6, p.356 (PDF376); fixed-point equaliser construction after Lemma 5.6.5"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等topos，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 为指定子对象分类子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega\">\\(j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7b9d7a3ecba84e9e\" href=\"?note=7b9d7a3ecba84e9e\" title=\"16-df-nucleus\">16-df-nucleus</a> 的nucleus。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x:X\\to\\Omega\">\\(x:X\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 为广义元素。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_j\">\\(\\Omega_j\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_j:\\Omega_j\\to\\Omega\">\\(i_j:\\Omega_j\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 为已选定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_\\Omega\">\\(1_\\Omega\\)</span> 的等化子：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ji_j=i_j\">\\(ji_j=i_j\\)</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:Y\\to\\Omega\">\\(f:Y\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"jf=f\">\\(jf=f\\)</span> 时，存在唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:Y\\to\\Omega_j\">\\(h:Y\\to\\Omega_j\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_jh=f\">\\(i_jh=f\\)</span>。有限极限保证可作此选择；这里只定义相对于该选择的对象，不声称不同等化子选择字面相同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fixed}_j\">\\(\\mathrm{Fixed}_j\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}(j)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}(j)\\)</span> 是下文新记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fixed}_j(x)\\Longleftrightarrow jx=x,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Fix}(j)\\coloneqq\\Omega_j,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Fixed}_j(x)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal E(X,\\Omega_j))\\ i_jh=x.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Fixed}_j(x)\\Longleftrightarrow jx=x,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Fix}(j)\\coloneqq\\Omega_j,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Fixed}_j(x)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal E(X,\\Omega_j))\\ i_jh=x.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原稿的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_j=\\operatorname{Eq}(j,1_\\Omega)\">\\(i_j=\\operatorname{Eq}(j,1_\\Omega)\\)</span> 没有给出Eq的函数签名，也混淆等化子箭头与对象。现在由显式等化子泛性质绑定所选对象及箭头，Fix在这项选择下有确定值；遮去Remark不丢失存在性和唯一性条件。最后等价式直接由泛性质及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ji_j=i_j\">\\(ji_j=i_j\\)</span> 得到。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-nucleus","status":"resolved","id":"7b9d7a3ecba84e9e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-nucleus]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"3744a99e6a5c0037","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-nucleus","status":"resolved","id":"7b9d7a3ecba84e9e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等topos，$\\Omega$ 为指定子对象分类子，$j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 为 [[16-df-nucleus]] 的nucleus。$x:X\\to\\Omega$ 为广义元素。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"x:X\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_j","display":false},{"tex":"i_j:\\Omega_j\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"1_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"ji_j=i_j","display":false},{"tex":"f:Y\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"jf=f","display":false},{"tex":"h:Y\\to\\Omega_j","display":false},{"tex":"i_jh=f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fixed}_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fix}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fixed}_j(x)\\Longleftrightarrow jx=x,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Fix}(j)\\coloneqq\\Omega_j,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Fixed}_j(x)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal E(X,\\Omega_j))\\ i_jh=x.","display":true},{"tex":"i_j=\\operatorname{Eq}(j,1_\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"ji_j=i_j","display":false}],"bytes":1539,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-244","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-fixed-point|df-fixed-point]]"}],"outgoing":["7b9d7a3ecba84e9e","3744a99e6a5c0037"]}